---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Site hero="split" footerTagline="Empowering Care, Improving Lives.">
  <section class="hero-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.02fr 0.98fr; align-items: stretch; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; padding: clamp(46px, 6vw, 86px) clamp(24px, 4vw, 58px);">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 570px;">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">For Maryland DDA Community Pathways families</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(33px, 4.3vw, 48px); line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.036em; color: var(--clairo-navy); max-width: 19ch;">You deserve more from your Maryland DDA services.</h1>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 18.5px; line-height: 29px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--clairo-blue); max-width: 48ch;">More choice. Better support for caregivers. Less administrative burden for families.</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 54ch;">Whether your services are traditionally managed or self-directed, Clairo Care was built to put participants and the people providing their care first.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
          <a href="/how-it-works"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">See how Clairo works</Button></a>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0px, 1fr)); gap: 11px 22px; margin-top: 28px; max-width: 520px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Choose caregivers you know and trust</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Competitive caregiver wages</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">More flexibility and transparency</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">We handle the administration</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-panel" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(32px, 4vw, 58px); background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.16), rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.04));">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 420px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); padding: 26px;">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 12px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Built around your care team.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">The people who know the participant best should be at the center of care.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Bring caregivers you already know</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Qualified family and friends may be eligible</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Clairo handles payroll, compliance and support</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="families" style="background: var(--background); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px); padding-bottom: clamp(58px, 7vw, 90px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Different models. Different challenges.</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">What does your experience look like today?</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 65ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Maryland families receive DDA services in different ways. The challenges aren't always the same — and neither should the conversation be.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-top: 40px;">
        <article class="clairo-card" style="overflow: hidden;">
          <div style="padding: 28px 28px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Traditional services</p>
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 27px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">You may want more control.</h3>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">For families receiving services through an agency-based provider.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 20px 28px 26px;">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Little say in who is assigned to provide care</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Difficulty recruiting and retaining great caregivers</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Caregiver turnover disrupting important relationships and routines</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Limited flexibility around schedules and daily life</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Limited visibility into how service funding supports your care team</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 17px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.08);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">What families often want</p>
              <p style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">More choice, stronger caregiver relationships, and a provider built around the participant.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/traditional-services" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">Explore Clairo for traditional services →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="clairo-card" style="overflow: hidden;">
          <div style="padding: 28px 28px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Self-Directed Services</p>
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 27px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">You may want to protect the control you already have.</h3>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">For families who value the flexibility and caregiver choice they've built through SDS.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 20px 28px 26px;">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Uncertainty around changing DDA rules</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Concern about maintaining caregiver wages</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Questions around the 60/40 framework and budget flexibility</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Administrative and employer responsibilities</span></div>
              <div style="padding: 11px 0px; display: flex; gap: 11px;"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(156, 163, 175); margin-top: 7px; flex: 0 0 auto;"></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Concern about keeping caregivers already trusted by the participant</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 17px 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.08);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">What families often want</p>
              <p style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">To keep the people and flexibility they value while reducing uncertainty and administrative burden.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/self-directed-services" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">Explore options for SDS families →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--clairo-navy); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(58px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(58px, 7vw, 88px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 790px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">One model built differently</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.14; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Clairo gives families another option.</h2>
        <p style="margin: 17px auto 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 68ch;">Clairo is a Maryland DDA provider agency designed to combine professional administrative support with more choice, flexibility, and caregiver focus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 38px;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-weight: 800;">1</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 17px 0px 8px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">You choose the people.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Bring caregivers who already know and understand the participant, including qualified family and friends when permitted.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-weight: 800;">2</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 17px 0px 8px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We invest in caregivers.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Our low-overhead model is designed to direct more of the available service funding toward the people actually providing care.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 26px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <div style="width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.18); color: var(--clairo-light-blue); font-weight: 800;">3</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 17px 0px 8px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We handle the rest.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Clairo manages hiring, payroll, training, billing, compliance, and provider administration so families don't have to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 26px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 24px 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div style="max-width: 720px;">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 750;">The goal isn't to tell families which model is better.</p>
          <p style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 21px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">It's to give families another provider option that puts the participant, the caregiver relationship, and quality of care first.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact"><Button>See if Clairo fits</Button></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="wages" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px);">
      <div style="background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 54px); position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="position: absolute; right: -68px; top: -70px; width: 230px; height: 230px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(92, 182, 242, 0.09);"></div>
        <div style="position: relative;">
          <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">More for the people providing care</p>
          <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(27px, 3.6vw, 40px); line-height: 1.13; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 22ch;">More of the funding reaches your caregiver.</h2>
          <p style="margin: 18px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 69ch;">Clairo's low-overhead model is built to prioritize the people doing the work — with competitive wages, mileage reimbursement, and benefits for eligible caregivers.</p>
          <div class="four-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin-top: 34px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); overflow: hidden;">
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Hourly Rate</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">$31.50–$51/hr</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Base hourly range</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Mileage Reimbursement</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4 miles per hour worked</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Reimbursed per shift</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Health Benefits</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Health Insurance &amp; PTO</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">For eligible caregivers</p>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 22px 20px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; background: rgb(20, 29, 51);">
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Quarterly Wellness</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; align-self: center; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.1vw, 29px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Whatever restores you!</p>
              <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 19px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">A quarterly wellness benefit</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 25px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/wages-and-benefits"><Button>See full wages &amp; benefits →</Button></a>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 18px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft); max-width: 66ch;">*Wages vary by service, participant circumstances, available service funding, employee eligibility, and other applicable factors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="how" style="background: var(--background); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); text-align: center;">
      <p class="clairo-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="clairo-h2">More choice doesn't have to mean more work.</h2>
      <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 62ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">We'll help you understand your options, build around the participant's care team, and handle the provider administration behind the scenes.</p>
      <div class="four-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; text-align: left;">
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px;">
          <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">1</div>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Talk with us</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Tell us about the participant, current services, care team, and what isn't working today.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px;">
          <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">2</div>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Explore your options</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">We'll explain which services Clairo may be able to provide and what a transition could look like.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px;">
          <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">3</div>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Bring your care team</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">When appropriate, caregivers the participant already knows and trusts can apply to work through Clairo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 24px;">
          <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">4</div>
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">We handle the administration</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground);">Clairo manages onboarding, payroll, training, billing, compliance, and ongoing provider support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;"><a href="/how-it-works"><Button variant="outline">See the full process →</Button></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
