  <section id="faq" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 84px);">
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">A few things families usually want to know.</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <div style="padding: 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Is Clairo a traditional provider or Self-Directed Services?</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 82ch;">Clairo is a provider agency for the services Clairo delivers. Our model is designed to preserve many of the things families value — caregiver choice, strong compensation, flexibility, and participant involvement — while Clairo handles provider administration.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Can my current caregiver work through Clairo?</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 82ch;">Often, existing caregivers can apply to become Clairo employees, subject to service requirements, qualifications, onboarding, and the participant's individual circumstances.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Do I have to leave SDS completely to use Clairo?</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 82ch;">Not necessarily. Depending on the participant's plan, services, authorizations, and DDA requirements, selected services may be delivered by Clairo while other applicable services remain self-directed.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 20px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
          <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Does Clairo handle payroll and compliance?</p>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0px 0px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 82ch;">For services delivered by Clairo, Clairo handles its associated employment, payroll, training, billing, compliance, and provider responsibilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/faq" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750;">View all FAQs →</a>
